      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🎨 Color Guide\n\n🔵 Blue = You (the user)\n🟢 Green = WhatsApp\n🟠 Orange = Server work\n🔴 Red = Safety check\n🟡 Yellow = Your data\n🟣 Purple = AI & Search\n🪦 Teal = Calendar (if needed)\n🪧 Pink = Payment (if needed)\n\n- - dashed = optional step\n  (only runs when needed)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "legend",
      "originalText": "🎨 Color Guide\n\n🔵 Blue = You (the user)\n🟢 Green = WhatsApp\n🟠 Orange = Server work\n🔴 Red = Safety check\n🟡 Yellow = Your data\n🟣 Purple = AI & Search\n🪦 Teal = Calendar (if needed)\n🪧 Pink = Payment (if needed)\n\n- - dashed = optional step\n  (only runs when needed)",
      "roundness": null
    },
